// Mabel vault root also contains the Odysseus source repository.
// Only synchronize the Obsidian knowledge folders below.
// Code is updated using Git on each device; runtime DBs remain local.
//
// First matching rule wins. Keep the protected patterns BEFORE the includes.
// Syncthing NEVER synchronizes .stignore itself. Each device needs this file.
// Check Syncthing -> Folder -> Edit -> Ignore Patterns before first scan.

// Never sync common temp files, credentials or live databases,
// including if someone accidentally saves them inside a vault note folder.
(?d).DS_Store
(?d)Thumbs.db
(?d)*.swp
(?d)*.swo
(?d)*~
.env
.env.*
secrets.env
secrets.env.*
*.db
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
*.sqlite-*
*.pem
*.key

// Allow only these top-level Obsidian note and attachment collections.
// Leading / keeps Syncthing from crawling the huge application source tree.
!/memory
!/identity
!/knowledge
!/projects
!/journal
!/attachments

// Ignore everything else (Git metadata, source, dependencies, .obsidian,
// Docker volumes, logs, models, caches and arbitrary new root files).
*
